@startuml advice-engine
!include _style.puml
title Fuel Factor — 3. The advice engine (the deck's own sentences, on plain events)

start
:Food + portion from the picker;
:Look up food_items\n-> per-portion macros;
:Sum the day's total\ncarbs · protein · fat · kcal;

:Compute the band\nbody_weight x g/kg\nshown as a range, not a midpoint; <<fuel>>
note right
  training  5-7 g/kg
  rest      3-4 g/kg
  From the Week 1 material.
  No threshold is invented.
end note

:Evaluate advice_rules (rows, not code);

split
  if (A meal slot has no carbs?) then (yes)
    :"Nasi, ubi jalar or roti all count.";
  endif
split again
  if (No breakfast on a training day?) then (yes)
    :The Week 1 breakfast message;
  endif
split again
  if (Trained, nothing logged in 30 min?) then (yes)
    :Refuel window — 3:1 carbs to protein;
  endif
split again
  if (Urine colour >= 5?) then (yes)
    :Hydration — 2% body weight lost\n-> about 10% slower sprints;
  endif
end split

:Rank by severity, keep the top three;

note right
  Every seed string is a sentence
  from the Week 1 material. The app
  invents no nutrition guidance and
  no thresholds to fire it.
end note

:Render the advice cards; <<go>>
stop
@enduml
